  "purpose": "An independent oracle for the Manitoba builder. Rules are generated from M.R. 165/91, which controls; this transcription of the 2026 guide is compared against every generated rule so that a parsing or interpretation error shows up as a disagreement instead of as a confident answer. It is never used to produce a rule.",
