      "transcribedOn": "2026-09-20",
      "whatChanged": "Two pages of 72. Page 14 gained the permanent-daylight-time notice transcribed below; page 16 changed a departmental URL. Every other transcribed fact was re-verified against the new document and is unchanged: the three residency definitions verbatim, the chronic wasting disease statement and all 25 listed game hunting areas, the upland windows and bag limits including the sharp-tailed note, and all 34 white-tailed deer season windows.",
      "establishedBy": "The superseded edition was retrieved from the Internet Archive and hashes to the value above, so the two editions were diffed rather than inferred. Two apparent mismatches were extraction artefacts and not changes: the new PDF renders 'white- tailed' across a line break and 'NOTE: I n GHAs' with a kerning split."
    }
